<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 3.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 3.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flights in and out of St Petersburg's airports may be postponed on Friday morning because of heavy fog, the Russian Weather Service said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The probability of the forecast being accurate is 70 percent, it said.</p>
<p>St Petersburg has one international airport, Pulkovo, and some smaller domestic airports.</p>
<p>Other airports in the nearby Baltic states and Russia's northwest region could also be closed on Friday because of strong winds and low clouds, the service said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
